Z||000000||84sleepr||10-08-2001||03:00 PM||||I figure I should share some of my sorrow with my fellow fiero owner's:<P>I just purchased a 84 SE about a month ago, this is my first fiero, and I instantly fell in love with it, I got a wicked deal and instantly started researching a slightly better engine replacement for the pathetically under-powered 2.5L. Well, a family friend of mine just found a 3800 SC, from a 98 GTP in Texas and I was arranging payment when it happened... Some senial old lady when through a stop sign and smoked me in the rf fender...OUCH! I was a little less than impressed.  It looks like a writeoff...<P>Well...now i got a 3800SC but no fiero... however I am now addicted to them and am sure I will pick up another in the next few months, when spring comes i'm sure to be prowling the streets of Winnipeg in another fiero... Stupid Old B*tch!!!||||reg||9
Z||000001||The Fieromaster||10-08-2001||03:07 PM||||I know the feeling!  It was a 82 year old lady who made a left infront of my best friend thinking "she had enough time" causing him to hit her and he died in the hospital 16 hours later!<P>They should test them every year past a certain age!!<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif">       <FONT COLOR="red">"Raced That, Wrecked Better"</FONT>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif">    <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.askfelons.com/fieromaster/fieromastergif1.gif"">               <BR><B>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000</B><BR><FONT COLOR="blue"><B>AIM: Fieromaster</B></FONT><BR><B><FONT COLOR="purple">1985 GT ~ Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="maroon">1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX ~ Maroon w/ Hella Balls!(GSX = AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000</FONT></B>||||reg||1
