Z||000007||sqoach||10-08-2001||10:16 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Steve Normington:<BR><B> [QUOTE]Originally posted by The Fieromaster:<BR>[b]They should test them every year past a certain age!!</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>There are stupid drivers of every age. They should test everyone every two years.[/B][/QUOTE]<P>Sounds like a good idea. I wouldn't mind. The problem is with elderly people, they <I>think</I> they're driving safe. They should at least get an eye exam or something. Younger people know what they're doing (most of the time) and just like to drive recklessly. They can drive safe if they wanted to.<P>------------------<BR>-Adam<BR><FONT COLOR="BLUE">sqoach@yahoo.com</FONT><BR>            <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sqoach.gif">         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">            <BR>^^^^^^<B>new project</B>^^^^^^<BR><LI><FONT SIZE="1">84 SE (FOR SALE)*SOLD*<BR><LI>85 Coupe (parts car)($50)*sale pending*<BR><LI>86 SC</FONT>||||reg||1
